{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal setup using scvi_n200 RNA and resnet50 image encoders with avgpool aggregation, comparing it to the concat fusion baseline (config_007). Validation accuracy (0.6776) and F1 (0.6464) suggest weighted fusion improves performance over concat in this configuration. Uncertainty remains about whether this improvement generalizes to other encoder combinations or if other factors like aggregation methods could further enhance results."
}

